      "text": "Every place … your feet shall tread shall be yours, Deut. 11:24. Thou shalt not muzzle the ox when he treadeth out the corn, Deut. 25:4 (1 Cor. 9:9; 1 Tim. 5:18). Thou shalt tread upon the lion and adder, Ps. 91:13. I have trodden the winepress alone, Isa. 63:3. Lord … will come down, and tread upon the high places, Micah 1:3. as a young lion among the flocks of sheep … treadeth down, Micah 5:8 (3 Ne. 20:16; 21:12). ye shall tread down the wicked, Mal. 4:3 (3 Ne. 25:3).",
